  "doctrine": [],
  "note": "Sabaic ḥfnnhn counts two containers or measures of first fruits. The inscription does not establish their capacity. Kogan, Proto-Semitic Lexicon §6.3.1.1, also compares Amharic əffəñ, Mehri ḥāfən and Jibbali ḥáfən. Hophni’s name resembles this Hebrew word, but its derivation is disputed."
